  _id: 01Page_03-ThomasEdisonLife
  _middleImage: {fileID: 21300000, guid: c54935692042a994a861934d59696228, type: 3}
  _descriptionTitle: The controversial part
  _description: "Edison was no saint \u2014 he was a ruthless businessman. He fought
    Tesla in the War of the Currents, backing DC against Tesla's AC, even electrocuting
    animals in public to make AC look dangerous.\nHe lost \u2014 we use AC today
    \u2014 and often took credit for his team's work."
